  "landingBudgetSummarySixMonths": "Six months is enough to turn the move into a budgeted plan instead of a sequence of reactive expenses.",
  "landingBudgetSummaryAsap": "Since the move is close, your reserve matters as much as the city choice. Use this estimate to avoid arriving with too little runway.",
