  "arrivalExecutionHealthTitle": "Set your first health fallback",
  "arrivalExecutionHealthBody": "Know where your first public or private health access point is so a routine issue does not become chaos on arrival.",
  "arrivalExecutionBankTitle": "Stabilize payments and banking flow",
  "arrivalExecutionBankBody": "Make sure your first local payment flow works: account, Pix, card use, and how you will move money in the first month.",
  "arrivalExecutionHousingTitle": "Turn housing into routine, not just entry",
  "arrivalExecutionHousingBody": "After arriving, confirm whether the chosen area really supports work, transport, safety, and the pace of daily life you need.",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalWorkTitle": "Turn arrival into employability",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalWorkBody": "Use the first month to test how documents, language, and city actually affect your chances of getting work.",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalRemoteTitle": "Turn arrival into a stable remote base",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalRemoteBody": "Validate internet reliability, a quiet routine, banking flow, and the real cost of maintaining remote work from the new city.",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalStudyTitle": "Turn arrival into a study routine",
