  "arrivalExecutionGoalRetireTitle": "Turn arrival into a predictable routine",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalRetireBody": "Use the first month to test whether health access, neighborhood routine, and recurring costs feel sustainable in practice.",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalQualityTitle": "Turn arrival into real quality of life",
  "arrivalExecutionGoalQualityBody": "Use the first month to verify whether the city feels right in daily life, not only on paper or in rankings.",
  "arrivalExecutionRealityCheckTitle": "Do a reality check at 90 days",
  "arrivalExecutionRealityCheckBody": "Compare your real costs, routine friction, and city fit against what the plan suggested. This is where the move stops being hypothetical.",
