  "migrationPlanCopilotQuickQuestionDocumentsAnswer": "Start with the documents that take longer to obtain or expire sooner. The document stage helps you separate what unlocks residence, CPF, and practical arrival without pushing you into a full bureaucratic flow all at once.",
